      "type": "text",
      "value": "Browser groups KycSubmissionPage (KOL) and KycApprovalPage (reviewer) in separate authenticated sessions. JWT/role guards run before controller calls; DTO checks precede methods. Expanded case: existing COLLABORATOR profile and Wallet. Initial GET/profile and refresh calls are summarized.",
