      "y": 2707,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ID photos: separate upload to Cloudinary, with FileReader Data URL fallback. References are saved in socialLinksJson. Form requires tax/bank/channel data; bank fields are optional in SubmitKycDto. No automatic tax/bank verification is shown.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2757,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Missing profile is created by submitKyc. New/rejected submissions become UNVERIFIED; editing a VERIFIED profile keeps VERIFIED. UNVERIFIED plus submitted ID is displayed as pending, not a separate database PENDING status. Social channel synchronization is awaited after profile persistence.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2812,
      "w": 2750,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
