      "value": "Legacy admin/pending and admin/:id/review allow Shop/Admin/Manager. Shared UI instead calls admin/applications and admin/kol/:id/review (Admin/Manager only): ordinary Shop receives 403. Shop approval through the legacy API is separate from that UI.",
